<title>SINGAPORE: FCC sells Heshe stake.</title>
<headline>FCC sells Heshe stake.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property group First Capital Corporation (FCC) said on Wednesday it has sold its 40.99 million shares in retailer Heshe Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>A company statement said FCC sold its 13.14 percent Heshe stake for a total consideration of Singapore $12.3 million or S$0.30 a share.</p>
<p>It did not say who the buyer of the Heshe shares was. After the sale, FCC ceases to be a shareholder of Heshe.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 873080)</p>
</text>
